                                                "sense_id": "f66e1c94-c1d2-3800-ad16-79b2580cc8b6",
                                                "text": "The day after the issuance of the interlocutory injunction he was interviewed by a StarPhoenix reporter as part of a larger article on \"Cybersquatting\" as the domain name game has come to be called."
                                            }
